        Kubernetes taints
        to apply to nodes. Structure is documented below.
    windowsNodeConfig : ContainerGcpmUpboundIoV1beta1ClusterSpecForProviderNodeConfigWindowsNodeConfig, default is Undefined, optional
        windows node config
    workloadMetadataConfig : ContainerGcpmUpboundIoV1beta1ClusterSpecForProviderNodeConfigWorkloadMetadataConfig, default is Undefined, optional
        workload metadata config
    """


